WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.880
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.250
Someone once said...

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.220
They're male and female 
and get along very well,

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:56.090
so much that they always carry each 
other around on their shoulders.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:03.900
Piggyback Shrimp created by 
Nana Mizuki-san of Tokyo!

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.560
Piggyback Shrimp!

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.860
Look at how in love they 
are. Thank you for the PDA.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:09.370
There is ramen that's said to be a 
favorite of Zebra of the Four Kings.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.540
At first glance, it looks 
like regular ramen...

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:23.020
...but it's as filling as 500 servings 
and if you don't eat it all...

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:25.850
Don't get cocky!

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:28.590
...Zebra will get mad at you.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:34.630
Zebramen created by Kenji 
Matsuda-san of Tokyo!

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:34.630
Zebramen! Which may or may not exist...

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.570
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:43.500
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:51.810
The Four Kings Assemble! The Gourmet 
World Monsters, the Four-Beasts, Awaken!

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.860
Meal King

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:40.960
Just what I expected from 
Meal King's main shop.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.690
Everything's absolutely delicious!

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.600
Yeah. It's wonderful.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.530
A ten-star restaurant.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:49.330
And it's worth every star.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.830
It's just too bad...

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.870
The symbol of Gourmet Town, Gourmet Tower,

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.340
the 330th floor of the Knife Building.

00:03:57.140 --> 00:04:00.910
But the beautiful view from 
the observation floor...

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.150
Like this, it's...

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.450
True.

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.780
It's a sight you'd never expect 
to see in the Gourmet Age.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:12.460
I suppose it's another world crisis 
happening as the Gourmet Eclipse nears.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:18.930
The IGO has declared a state of emergency.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.460
Please follow the instructions 
of IGO employees

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.100
and evacuate to the Human 
World Central Sector.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.330
I repeat...

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:29.040
The IGO has declared a state of emergency.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.170
Please follow the instructions 
of IGO employees

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.810
and evacuate to the Human 
World Central Sector.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.980
I like the city quiet like this.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.570
Meal King's special Green Pepper Steak!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.170
The taste really is fit for a king!

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.290
Honestly, the way you eat, no class!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.050
You two never change.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:19.950
Yeah.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:24.860
But the activation of our Gourmet 
Cells doesn't even compare to before.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.760
Of course, that includes you too, Sunny.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.800
And you as well, Coco.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:34.130
What kind of training were you doing?

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:46.010
Full Stomach City is usually so lively...

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.490
You are so slow! Do you 
know how long I waited?!

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.430
I-I'm sorry, Rin-san!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.660
Don't worry about it.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.630
Hey, Zebra!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:10.070
Leave some of Meal King's 
special gyoza for me!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.670
Don't eat all of 'em!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.710
Well, what did you expect?

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:22.050
It's also a cardinal mistake on your part.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.180
Why?!

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.750
If there's something you want to 
eat, you've gotta go for it fast.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.960
Because you never know 
what's going to happen.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:34.560
Eating your favorites that someone 
also wants requires a swift attack.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.090
I don't know about that.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:39.930
I always save my favorites for last.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:40.870
Why?

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:45.000
When you look forward to 
your favorites at the end,

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.340
they taste even better, don't you think?

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:49.570
Put another way,

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:54.310
if there's hope left at the end, 
any circumstances can be endured.

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.710
The order in which you eat things,

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.220
likes, dislikes... The hell with all of it.

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:03.920
'Cause food is everyone's favorite!

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:08.260
All you gotta do is enjoy it all.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.230
And be grateful to the ingredients.

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.730
Grateful, huh?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:14.730
Like Honoring the Food that we all learned.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.140
What do you think, Zebra?

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.440
I don't give a damn about any of that crap!

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:27.880
That makes sense.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.780
For Zebra...

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:32.950
But take a guy who's got somethin' 
delicious right in front of him,

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.950
but he don't touch it 'cause 
he's waitin' for more... {sic}

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.190
I can't believe a bastard like that.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:43.890
You're somethin' else.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.000
Agreed.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:48.160
It's unusual for you to have an opinion.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.750
Bubble Fruit?!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.720
That's right!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:11.320
Chiru-san and I were working on it this 
week at Vanishing Japanese Cuisine!

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:19.660
And somehow, we succeeded in cooking with it!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.560
That's amazing!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.500
I'm sure Toriko and the others 
will be happy about it.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.400
Um, what is that?

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.440
Oh, this...

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.970
It's a Capture Level measuring device.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.110
I call it Measure Tongue!

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:34.210
Measure Tongue...?

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.880
It's just recently been perfected.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.550
With it, I can measure the Capture 
Level of a Beast even if it's over 100!

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.280
O-Over 100?!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:45.790
I-I guess I'll have to encounter 
Beasts like that soon...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:49.760
Of course! We're talking monsters 
that threaten the whole human race.

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:52.260
R-Right...

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.490
And they're also...

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.300
...the final training ingredient.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:03.640
But I'm surprised the old man gave us 
all the same final training ingredient.

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:08.040
And he certainly saved the 
toughest one for last.

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:11.480
But this one's gonna come to us.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:15.010
We don't gotta waste any 
time lookin' around for it.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.290
The Sleeping Monster of the Gourmet World...

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:21.620
Four-Beasts...

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.270
IGO-declared Level 5 State of Emergency

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:48.950
IGO has declared a level 
5 state of emergency.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.780
IGO-declared Level 5 State of Emergency

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:52.580
According to IGO's statement, 
the Four-Beasts have already

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:55.820
IGO Four-Beasts' Projected Paths

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.820
gotten as far as the borderline between 
the Gourmet World and the Human World.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:10:01.260
Live from Food Park Plaza
Recommended that 30 Billion People Evacuate

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.220
It's recommended that 30 billion 
people all over the world

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:01.730
evacuate to the Human World Central Sector.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.160
Please evacuate as soon as possible.

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:06.660
Okay, that's a wrap!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.370
We'd better evacuate to Food Park Plaza too.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.640
But...

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:13.470
You can report the news from the plaza.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:23.180
Uumen Bureau Chief.

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.680
Is the evacuation of the human race finished?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:30.690
Yes. It took a week, but it's 
pretty much a fait accompli.

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.720
We had 800 million people alone 
evacuate to the Food Park here.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.690
Still, who would've guessed that the 
Gourmet World with all its tasty treats

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.900
would come all the way to the Human World?

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.430
The Four-Beasts are such a 
bother, don't you think...

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.500
...Chief Mansom?

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.610
Can't be helped.

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:53.180
They're terribly picky eaters 
with an unbalanced diet.

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.180
Unfortunately,

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.080
they like to eat humans.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.280
Once every several hundred years...

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:05.290
They wake as if calculating the increase 
in the population, and come to feed.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.220
They're true monsters.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.390
But...

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:11.490
...humans... the human race won't lose.

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.460
The last time the Four-Beasts attacked,

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:18.100
it's said that the young President 
Ichiryu drove them off.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.840
Although now the president 
is in the Gourmet World.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.370
At Biotope 0, not here...

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.180
We have hope.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:36.080
Yeah. Toriko and the others. 
The Four Kings! Our new hope.

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.650
Hey, Zebra! Dammit!

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:42.190
How dare you eat the steamed 
dumplings I was gonna have!

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:43.690
The early bird gets the worm.

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:46.760
You don't think to leave a 
couple out of friendship?!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:48.460
Course not!

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:50.230
"Course not"?! Asshole!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.870
All I'm doin' is eatin' what I wanna eat!

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.770
Yeah, I know...

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:56.570
I know, but look... I mean...

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:04.240
Even though you'll soon be off 
to battle the Four-Beasts...

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:09.020
Dear me! None of you are 
even one millimeter nervous.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:12.550
One Millimeter Yuda,
Owner-chef of Meal King, Leading Figure in Medicinal Cooking

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.750
Owner-chef Yuda!

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:16.790
Your cooking is wonderful, and you don't 
even allow one millimeter to be off.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.890
Not to mention you're showing us a good time.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.830
Yeah. That's the Meal King 
of the Gourmet Age for ya!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.830
I see...

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.230
I'm happy to hear that.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:27.370
Look, I brought more.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:32.070
It's my special menu, made without 
cutting even one millimeter of corners.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.740
Alright!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:37.380
We're really grateful to you for 
staying open at a time like this.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:41.810
What? I wouldn't close for one 
millimeter over something like this!

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:45.650
You don't reign at the top floor 
of Gourmet Tower for nothin'!

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.090
You're not shaken by even 
one millimeter, huh?

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:52.930
Although I had every last millimeter 
of employee evacuate, just in case.

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:57.730
Well, you're strong enough that there's 
no need to flee even one millimeter.

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:03.100
My cooking is Medicinal Cooking, 
which is high in nutrients.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:05.400
It fits Food's End perfectly.

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:08.170
Eat it all up without leaving one millimeter.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:09.770
More!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:10.710
That was farst! {sic}

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.940
Dammit, Zebra!

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.950
What are you eatin' it in an instant for?! 
Ain't no reason you gotta suck it up!

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:19.320
Shut yer pie hole! You twits 
are just too slow on the draw!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.720
Farst! That was too farst, Zebra-kun!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.820
Um... "Farst"?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.120
Everyone!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:26.960
Sorry we're late!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:27.790
Komatsu!

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.830
Toriko! I came too!

00:13:30.730 --> 00:13:31.630
Rin!

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.830
How'd it go with the Bubble Fruit?!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.230
Just a second!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.200
Here! As you can see,

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.100
I succeeded in cooking them!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.010
Impressive as always, Komatsu-kun.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:45.910
Bubble Fruit.

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.440
They're beautiful!

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:49.650
But why are you here, Rin?

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:51.450
I came because I've got important work to do!

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:51.980
Work?

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.390
Well, anyway, great job, 
Komatsu. You're amazing!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.790
Excellent.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:01.620
I see cooking that's not 
even one millimeter off.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.500
Chef Yuda, number five on the Chef's Ranking!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:09.930
P-P-Please give me your autograph!

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:14.270
Certainly. I'll sign this without 
even one millimeter of crookedness.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:17.910
Hey! Save the autographs for later!

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:21.080
More importantly, let's try the Bubble Fruit!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:25.580
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.580
Thank you for the food!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:32.450
So this is Bubble Fruit, the 
treasure of Chowlin Temple!

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.760
They're even more beautiful up close!

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.030
Looks pretty damn good...

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.930
I've had them once raw,

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:44.370
but how does cooked Bubble Fruit taste?

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:00.850
Delicious! The texture and 
sweetness is like rich pudding...

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.920
But it's not cloying! In 
fact, it's quite refreshing!

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:09.220
Yes. That's because after it melts on the 
tongue, crisp carbonation bubbles up!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.430
It's just as Master Chin said.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:17.160
It's much more delicious cooked than raw!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:26.010
T-This is...

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.980
Our Gourmet Cells are being activated!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:36.020
So it's an ingredient that's 
compatible for all Four Kings...

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.590
Bubble Fruit...

00:15:38.590 --> 00:15:41.750
It's been activated through 
the cooking process.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.820
I'm grateful to you, Chowlin Temple!

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:45.690
Komatsu!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:47.790
Right!

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:52.570
A-All I did was cook it so 
that it would taste good...

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.470
Well, time to get goin'?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.530
Wait a sec!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:16:00.410
I was entrusted with a video message 
from the president about this job.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:03.180
That's your important work?

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.510
Yeah. We'll go after you watch it.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:10.980
Have your cells level-upped?

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:15.020
Well, if you're watching 
this, I assume they have.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.090
Old man...

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.790
You knew all this was going to happen?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.830
Alright, about the Four-Beasts...

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:26.430
As you can deduce from the 
name, there are four of them.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:30.900
They're each entering the Human 
World from a different direction.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.840
It's always the same pattern.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:35.140
And so, by now

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.980
the IGO should have evacuated 
nearly all humans

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:42.850
to the 1,000 kilometer Central 
Sector in the Human World.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:46.180
That's the final line of defense.

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:49.950
You'll be on the other side of that line.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:52.060
Each of you will ambush one of the Beasts.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.620
I get it.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:57.590
The four of us will split up 
and defeat a Four-Beast apiece.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:58.860
Listen.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:01.570
If even one of you fails,

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:04.940
the line of defense will crumble 
and billions of people...

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:08.410
No, tens of billions of 
people will be sacrificed.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.410
It'll be the end of the Human World.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:15.710
It ain't even a possibility for me, 
but I'm worried about you jerks.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:17.710
It's not possible for us either!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:18.980
Still...

00:17:18.980 --> 00:17:20.180
How can I put it?

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:23.220
You four were munchkins once.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:24.690
But look at you now,

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.890
so big it's at the point where I can 
hand off an important job like this.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.190
You've grown up to be so strong.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.800
As your old man, I'm proud of you.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:34.930
Toriko...

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:36.300
Coco...

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:37.630
Sunny...

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.030
Zebra...

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:42.740
The Human World is in your hands!

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:43.570
Old man...

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.340
Oh, that's right!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:49.540
Hey!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.910
Enough sentimental crap!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:55.280
Let's beat an' eat the Four-Beasts!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.490
Look.

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:00.590
Your sidekicks are all 
here waitin' for youse.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:18.870
Terry!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:19.610
Kiss!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:20.040
Queen!

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:27.080
Kiss and Queen have both gotten way bigger!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:30.080
Hey, Zebra, don't you have a partner yet?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.790
You weaklings can team up if you want.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.990
I can handle anything on my own.

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:40.260
Although I am usin' a guy for 
transportation this time.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.300
W-What is that?!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.200
It's humongous!

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:52.010
That's my ride.

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:55.940
Darma Horse (Demon Beast) 
Capture Level: Unknown

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.810
It's a Daruma Horse.

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.850
I'm borrowing it from the 
Daruma mountain hermit.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:00.850
Who's the Daruma mountain hermit?

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:04.750
He just had to bring a weird, 
disgusting creature here...

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.550
No class at all!

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:10.860
Well, at least this confirms 
that we've all got mobility.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.260
Yeah.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.100
Did you hear?

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.700
Rumor has it that the president 
of IGO isn't in the Human World!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.600
Seriously?!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:29.740
It's over! This whole place is just 
gonna be a farm for the Four-Beasts!

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:31.340
We'll all be eaten!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:36.210
Citizens, take it easy!

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:39.120
I promise you, the Four-Beasts 
will be stopped...

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:43.920
...by the Four Kings Gourmet Hunters! 
Toriko! Coco! Sunny! And Zebra!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:56.230
Four-Beasts, Mount Turtle (Volcanic 
Crustacean Beast) Estimated Capture Level: 100

00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:11.150
Four-Beasts, Invite Death (Mollusk Mammal 
Beast) Estimated Capture Level: 100

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.990
Four-Beasts, King Octopus Kong (Mollusk 
Mammalian Fish Beast) Estimated Capture Level: 100

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:36.940
Four-Beasts, Fang King (Mammalian 
Beast) Estimated Capture Level: 100

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:42.550
Alright...

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:45.250
Who's going to get which Four-Beast?

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:47.950
That's somethin' to look 
forward to when we get there.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:06.230
I have been alone

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:13.640
Ever since that day

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:21.420
All I got was a definite history

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:28.020
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:31.760
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:35.200
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.970
A dream is still a dream

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:42.570
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.370
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.910
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:57.420
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:03.960
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:08.530
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:15.700
Hiding Level 33

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:11.830
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 33.

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.770
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds.

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:15.700
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.070
What a heaping helping 
of beautiful fireworks!

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:21.670
Oooh!

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:23.710
Aaaah!

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.950
Everyone looks like they're 
having so much fun.

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:30.280
I wish I could've been there. Shucks...

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:34.550
Yun is... right here!

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:39.560
Could you find him?

00:22:39.560 --> 00:22:43.300
Yun used his great jumping ability to hide.

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:47.330
The Four Kings have moved out at last!

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:49.830
Will the world be okay?! 
What'll happen next time?!

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:54.120
The flame of battle has been lit...

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:56.890
Toriko, Coco, Sunny, Zebra,

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:58.410
you have to save us!

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:02.250
A Battle with the Existence of the Human Race 
on the Line! The Four-Beasts vs. the Four Kings!

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:04.290
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
